# SDK

ESM Node client for Pago. No Home Assistant license layer. Dates via dayjs (`YYYY-MM-DD`).

## Style

- No semicolons, no trailing commas, double quotes, 2-space indent, max 160 cols
- Domain types: prefix `T` (`TLocation`); native types for primitives
- Prefer lodash (`import _ from "lodash"`) at call site over one-off helpers
- No one-off named helpers/wrappers/path-builders — extract only when reused 2+ times
- Destructure with `|| {}` / `|| []`; avoid `?.` for field reads (optional calls OK)
- No nested ternaries; name booleans. Imperative: `if`, not `&&`
- No defensive code: no try/catch unless recovering (401 re-login); no fallbacks for required data
- Little noise: persist actual payloads; no remaps; `cleanDeep` means no null guards
- HTTP: axios.create per client; inject `http` in tests
- Dates: dayjs at the call site (`format("YYYY-MM-DD")`)
- Arrow `const` factories (`createPago`); nest single-use inside parent
- Return unwrapped API payloads; do not remap to Romanian display strings
